The '''Moogma''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from Lava on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
The Moogma can be fished up from Lava anywhere in the Crimson Isle, with a [[Fishing Rods|Lava Fishing Rod]]. It requires {{Skl|fishing|XXVIII}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Moogma''' is {{Green|1,200}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|25.82%|1|3.87|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

